  "{count, plural, one {# installed app has} other {# installed apps have}} new permissions awaiting your review.": "インストール済みアプリ {count, plural, other {# 個}}に、確認待ちの新しい権限があります。",
  "{count, plural, one {# installed app needs} other {# installed apps need}} an administrator to approve new permissions.": "インストール済みアプリ {count, plural, other {# 個}}の新しい権限は、管理者による承認が必要です。",
  "{count, plural, one {# left} other {# left}}": "{count, plural, other {残り # 回}}",
  "{count, plural, one {# more in a conversation you can't see} other {# more in conversations you can't see}}": "ほかに {count} 件（あなたが見られない場所）",
  "{count, plural, one {# more not listed} other {# more not listed}}": "ほかに {count} 件（一覧には表示されません）",
  "{count, plural, one {# more saved message is older than {days} days and isn't listed.} other {# more saved messages are older than {days} days and aren't listed.}}": "ほかにも {days} 日より前の保存済みメッセージが {count, plural, other {# 件}}あり、一覧には表示されていません。",
