  "{count, plural, one {Added # member to the channel} other {Added # members to the channel}}": "{count, plural, other {# 人のメンバーをチャンネルに追加しました}}",
  "{count, plural, one {Connect # server} other {Connect # servers}}": "{count} 件のサーバーを接続",
  "{count, plural, one {Connect and send request} other {Connect and send requests}}": "{count, plural, other {接続してリクエストを送信}}",
  "{count, plural, one {Connected # server} other {Connected # servers}}": "{count} 件のサーバーを接続しました",
  "{count, plural, one {Connecting # server. This takes a few minutes.} other {Connecting # servers. This takes a few minutes.}}": "{count, plural, other {# 個のサーバーを接続しています。数分かかります。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {Connecting {servers}. It shows under Connected servers once it's done.} other {Connecting {servers}. They show under Connected servers once it's done.}}": "{count, plural, other {{servers} を接続しています。完了すると「接続済みのサーバー」に表示されます。}}",
  "{count, plural, one {Only # backup code left.} other {Only # backup codes left.}} Regenerate them so you don't get locked out.": "{count, plural, other {バックアップコードは残り # 個です。}}ログインできなくなる前に再生成してください。",
