  "{count, plural, one {This agent on this Computer uses {runtime}. It keeps running, but its next start can't authenticate until someone signs in again:} other {These # agents on this Computer use {runtime}. They keep running, but their next start can't authenticate until someone signs in again:}}": "{count, plural, other {このコンピューターの # 個のエージェントが {runtime} を使っています。実行は続きますが、誰かが再びログインするまで、次回の起動時に認証できません：}}",
  "{count, plural, one {This {piRuntime} agent on this Computer may use {runtime}. It keeps running, but can't use {runtime} until someone adds it again:} other {These # {piRuntime} agents on this Computer may use {runtime}. They keep running, but can't use {runtime} until someone adds it again:}}": "{count, plural, other {このコンピューターの # 個の {piRuntime} エージェントが {runtime} を使っている可能性があります。実行は続きますが、誰かがもう一度追加するまで {runtime} は使えません：}}",
  "{count, plural, one {{servers} connects now.} other {{servers} connect now.}} An admin of each of the other servers can approve.": "{count, plural, other {{servers} はすぐに接続されます。}}他のサーバーは、それぞれの管理者が承認できます。",
  "{count, plural, one {{servers} connects now.} other {{servers} connect now.}} Any admin of {target} can approve.": "{count, plural, other {{servers} はすぐに接続されます。}}{target} の管理者なら誰でも承認できます。",
  "{count, plural, one {{servers} is already connected} other {{servers} are already connected}}": "{count, plural, other {{servers} はすでに接続されています}}",
